    "text": "1 days ago Emily Gregory and Alyson Woods each won their weight classes to lead the Oglethorpe County girls wrestling team to victory in the 13-team West Hall Spartan Invitational last weekend. Emily Wisham and Tori Miller finished second, and McKinley Grimes, Akira Owens and Amonie’ Gresham were third in their weight classes.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
